      "review_description": "Mustafa Merchant from Solar Merchant is a very non pushy sales guy who gives you the space and time to decide and doesn’t hassle you with the purchase. Also, given that he is one of the owners of the company, he’s always available to answer any questions you may have and explain everything in detail.Mustafa also has dedicated teams which handle the installation and doesn’t sub-contract to other installers, which just helps trust the whole system more since he’s aware about what exactly goes into the installation.They also handle everything from end to end, i.e. the complete installation as well as connectivity to the grid, change of meter, etc.",
